# Layer A density v5 fixture (Q-060 M-4 slices a+b combined): a bare
# dotted registry name (`Fs.List`, table-covered with readFx and the
# ArgRef(0) projection) plus `@auto` effect synthesis consuming the
# synthesized ForeignNode's projection in the same fixed-point loop.
# Two lines of program for what the explicit form writes in twelve.
@v=1 root=entries
dir STR "/safe"
entries APP Fs.List [dir] @auto
